---
/** Centered: a plan of one small card in the middle of an empty page. */
---

<span class="cover-sheet cover-plan" style="display:grid; place-items:center; width:208px; height:130px; background:var(--color-surface-tray); box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 .5px var(--color-line-contour)">
  <span class="cover-sheet cover-stack" style="--r:var(--radius-control); width:72px; padding:11px 10px; --gap:7px">
    <i class="cover-bar cover-bar-strong" style="width:32px"></i>
    <span class="cover-well" style="height:12px; --r:var(--radius-chip)"></span>
    <span class="cover-ink" style="height:12px; border-radius:calc(var(--radius-chip) * var(--corner-scale)); corner-shape:var(--corner-shape)"></span>
  </span>
</span>
